{"4028760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmo Cargo", "steam_appid": 4028760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/b4b67fdc904ceebbb2ea16bb79b9caaa.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is in danger! The fearsome Administrators are on a mission to organize the universe as they see fit, and destroy everything they consider disorderly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's still hope! A rebel force is preparing to foil their plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through different sectors and meet amazing aliens who can help you in your fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/a0dc514230c58e7cce33600b29e9d2bb.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are essential! Buy, trade, find and steal all kinds of wacky items with powerful effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them aboard your ship to create new synergies, high-powered chain reactions, and satisfying combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> them by collecting copies to unlock new effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your inventory</strong> by clearing cluttered slots to unlock even more possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0277c69e4d0332f38336443877ed6756.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traveling alone is no fun, and there's room in the ship's cockpit... Why not recruit some <strong>new crew members</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new characters can use their <strong>unique powers</strong> in combination with the ship's equipment for even <strong>more exciting combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/c6c99b8c60034b368373532c744a9a9b.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Administrators seek to <strong>eradicate disorder in the universe</strong>. Join the Rebels and help them defeat the minions of this fearsome organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic space battles matching inventory against inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly tough (and weird) enemies using items collected throughout the sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the minions have been defeated, your final mission will be to defeat the <strong>Chief Administrator</strong> — so you'd better be prepared!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/b4b67fdc904ceebbb2ea16bb79b9caaa.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/84532985d292a83bda3c1de77cb4281c.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is in danger! The fearsome Administrators are on a mission to organize the universe as they see fit, and destroy everything they consider disorderly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's still hope! A rebel force is preparing to foil their plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through different sectors and meet amazing aliens who can help you in your fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/a0dc514230c58e7cce33600b29e9d2bb.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/7be005c61e2908d4c36e132516cc40e5.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are essential! Buy, trade, find and steal all kinds of wacky items with powerful effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them aboard your ship to create new synergies, high-powered chain reactions, and satisfying combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> them by collecting copies to unlock new effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your inventory</strong> by clearing cluttered slots to unlock even more possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/0277c69e4d0332f38336443877ed6756.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/e7ab8e0abeec96f7fdbca1dd44db7480.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traveling alone is no fun, and there's room in the ship's cockpit... Why not recruit some <strong>new crew members</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new characters can use their <strong>unique powers</strong> in combination with the ship's equipment for even <strong>more exciting combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/c6c99b8c60034b368373532c744a9a9b.avif?t=1788190146\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.poster.avif?t=1788190146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.webm?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/extras/639ee0a7eeedde4f5fcfdcd6a5914e47.mp4?t=1788190146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Administrators seek to <strong>eradicate disorder in the universe</strong>. Join the Rebels and help them defeat the minions of this fearsome organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic space battles matching inventory against inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly tough (and weird) enemies using items collected throughout the sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the minions have been defeated, your final mission will be to defeat the <strong>Chief Administrator</strong> — so you'd better be prepared!</p>", "short_description": "Cosmo Cargo is an inventory autobattler roguelike PvE game in which you fight to maintain chaos in the galaxy. Collect and combine items in your ship to gain powerful effects and defeat the Administrators.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/71ce2f6aba0ee101cdef1ffb32cb7ba3aadd74d6/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1788190146", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028760/6dd1b34bb207ecc9728f26e5d49276bd57d43089/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=178